{"articleNo":"130681","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=130681&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"해양플랜트 국제공인 품질 전문가 양성 교육 안내(기간 연장)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.06.18","hit":"2373","attachments":[{"name":"(붙임 2) 교육프로그램.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=130681&attachNo=75254"},{"name":"(붙임 1) 해양플랜트 국제공인 품질전문가 양성 교육안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=130681&attachNo=75266"},{"name":"(붙임 3) 교육신청서, 자기소개서, 개인정보이용동의서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=130681&attachNo=75381"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">부경대학교와 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">재</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">한국조선해양기자재연구원에서 해양플랜트 품질역량강화를 위한 해양플랜트 국제공인 품질전문가 양성 교육 프로그램을 실시 운영하오니</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">관심있는 학생</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">졸업생 포함</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">들의 많은 참여 바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">사업명 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">해양플랜트 국제공인 품질전문가 양성사업</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">□ 신청기간 : <font color=\"#0055ff\"><strong>~6월 24일(수)까지</strong></font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">교육비 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전액 국비지원</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">무료교육</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">합숙교육시 기숙사 제공</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">교육대상 및 자격조건 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">해양플랜트 품질분야 및 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">API(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">미국석유협회</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">공인 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">Source Inspector </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">품질검사원</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">자격시험에 관심이 있는 학사 및 전문학사 재학생</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">졸업예정자</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">), </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">졸업유보자</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">졸업</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">자</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">미취업자</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">※자세한 내용은 첨부파일 참고하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
